I was thinking about thae interface for sacks/chests etc. Wouldn't it be easier
if we had a key that cycled through your inventory and then any sacks etc that
you were carrying. Then, you could just use all the ordinary commands for
dropping, picking up etc that you use for the inventory. For example, to drop
something from a sack, you would cycle to the sack, and then just d for drop.
This way you could pick things up straight into a sack or drop from a sack
straight onto the ground.

I'd like to hear other peoples thoughts on the interface for sacks etc, since
I find them the most painful part of the game (apart from dying of course :)
